Formic license declaration
===========================

Formic is an Eldy-based theme for Dolibarr ERP/CRM. This repository contains
the theme package: stylesheets, PHP include fragments, a small runtime script,
and image assets inherited from Dolibarr's bundled Eldy theme.

Formic is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify it under the
terms of the GNU General Public License as published by the Free Software
Foundation, either version 3 of the License, or (at your option) any later
version.

Formic is distributed in the hope that it will be useful, but WITHOUT ANY
WARRANTY; without even the implied warranty of MERCHANTABILITY or FITNESS FOR
A PARTICULAR PURPOSE. See the GNU General Public License for more details.

You should have received a copy of the GNU General Public License along with
this program. If not, see <https://www.gnu.org/licenses/>.

Derived work
------------

This repository contains files derived from Dolibarr's Eldy theme
(https://github.com/Dolibarr/dolibarr), copyright their respective authors and
licensed under the GNU General Public License, version 3 or later. Individual
source files retain their original copyright headers where applicable; those
notices remain in effect alongside this declaration.

No other third-party code is bundled in this repository. Runtime libraries the
theme integrates with at the CSS/JS level (CKEditor, Chart.js, ACE, jQuery,
select2, Font Awesome, and others) are provided by Dolibarr core at
installation time and are not part of this package.
